{"op": "replace", "segment": 36, "text": "5.3. is rightfully acquired from others who did not obtain it under obligation of confidentiality, provided it was not obtained, directly or indirectly, from Disclosing Party, as shown by contemporaneous written records that the Recipient must produce on request; or", "fixes": "S-010"},
{"op": "replace", "segment": 42, "text": "5.6.3. under those circumstances where Recipient files a lawsuit for retaliation against the Disclosing Party for reporting a suspected violation of law, Recipient may disclose the Disclosing Party's trade secret information to its attorney and may use the trade secret information in the court proceeding only to the extent reasonably necessary for that proceeding, if Recipient files any document containing the trade secret under seal and does not disclose the trade secret, except pursuant to court order.", "fixes": "S-009"},
{"op": "replace", "segment": 45, "text": "All such retained copies shall remain subject to the use and disclosure restrictions in this Agreement and shall be returned or destroyed in accordance with the return obligation in this Section 6.", "fixes": "S-004"},
{"op": "replace", "segment": 49, "text": "If Recipient is (in the reasonable written opinion of its outside counsel, a copy of which shall be provided to Disclosing Party) compelled to disclose any Confidential Information, or else be liable for contempt or other penalty or be subject to claims from a third party, Recipient shall first give Disclosing Party the written notice required under the preceding paragraph and may disclose only the portion of Confidential Information legally required, and such disclosure is without liability under this Agreement.", "fixes": "S-008"},
{"op": "replace", "segment": 87, "text": "The obligations of the Recipient under this Agreement shall survive the expiration or termination of this Agreement, including any termination under Section 3, shall not end with the Period of Exchange, and shall continue for the Period of Confidentiality set forth above.", "fixes": "S-003"}
]}

